%% D3 Query Flow (current). Owner Adil. Verified 2026-08-24. Commit 7670417. Reading notes in README.md
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as 📱 App
    participant N as Node :8000
    participant F as FastAPI :8001
    participant Q as Qdrant :6333
    participant O as OpenAI
    participant FS as Firestore

    A->>N: POST /api/query<br/>{query, role, userId, userEmail, sessionId}<br/>Bearer token attached
    Note over N: Token is NEVER verified.<br/>role and userId trusted as sent.

    N->>N: sanitize → validate → outputSanitize<br/>server.js:78

    N->>F: GET /filters
    F->>Q: scroll ENTIRE collection, 1000/page
    Note over F,Q: Uncached. Runs on every single query.<br/>vector_store.py:329-342
    Q-->>F: all distinct filter values
    F-->>N: 6 filter lists

    N->>N: extractFilters — substring match<br/>q.includes(modelNumber)<br/>server.js:359-391

    N->>F: POST /retrieve {question, 7 filters, top_k=5}
    F->>Q: scroll — TOC heading probe
    F->>Q: query_points chunk_type=child
    F->>Q: query_points chunk_type=table
    Note over F,Q: 2 searches, k each, then truncated to k total.<br/>Tables and text compete for the same 5 slots.
    F->>Q: retrieve — parent hydration per matched child
    F->>F: build prompt + rebuild Storage image URLs
    F-->>N: {prompt, sources[], context_blocks[]}

    N->>N: write latest_prompt.txt<br/>single global file, overwritten
    N->>O: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>role system prompt + retrieved context
    O-->>N: answer text

    N->>FS: audit_logs.set merge, arrayUnion message
    N->>N: detectAlerts — keyword scan of the answer
    alt alert.level == critical
        N->>FS: maintenance_tasks.add + Alerts.add
    end
    N-->>A: {text, sources, context_blocks, alert, priorityTask}

    A->>FS: Alerts.add x2 — client-side, after the fact
    Note over A,FS: The phone writes its own audit trail entries.<br/>services/api.js:85-113

